{"repositoryId":95706846,"availability":"available","full":"cyanharlow/purecss-vignes","name":"purecss-vignes","description":"HTML/CSS drawing in the style of 1930s poster art. Hand-coded entirely in HTML & CSS.","category":"Design","language":"CSS","stars":336,"forks":35,"created":"2017-06-28T20:01:33Z","updated":"2018-05-12T14:27:57Z","branch":"master","homepage":"https://cyanharlow.github.io/purecss-vignes/","topics":[],"demo":"https://cyanharlow.github.io/purecss-vignes/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:33.426Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:33.426Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:33.426Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T18:03:33.426Z","stars":336,"forks":35}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An ongoing series in which I create art using only CSS and HTML.","(Note: at one point I was using one or two SVG elements but I eventually grew tired of them and they've since been deleted, so this rule no longer applies. No offense to SVG.)","Because of the artistic nature of this project I have not concerned myself with cross-browser-compatibility, so the live preview will most likely look laughable in anything other than chrome."],"features":["All elements must be typed out by hand","Only Atom text editor and Chrome Developer Tools allowed.","SVG use is limited, and all shapes can only use hand-plotted coordinates and bezier curves - without the aid of any graphics editor."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cyanharlow/purecss-vignes/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"491c83b4566767002e608870897ccde76ff6e1470c5839f0a591351666b27e4e","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:33.552Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:33.552Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"An ongoing series in which I create art using only CSS and HTML.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cyanharlow/purecss-vignes/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"491c83b4566767002e6088708